      "spam": false,
      "value": "Would also like to add that in the kart example listed above, the room master colliding with any of the observed stationary players in karts will cause them to teleport back to the point where the room master actually sees them, on the secondary player's end. While somewhat understandable, it's fairly disconcerting to the player being teleported.",
