  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-02-07T14:51:35.915Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As of the February 2nd update, the Take Ownership RPC does not properly acquire ownership of synced objects from the room master. Clients that initiate an ownership request may gain partial ownership allowing them to manipulate the object on their end, but other players will not see these updates.\n\nThis bug is most prominent in any of the kart worlds which depend on the driver being able to obtain ownership of the kart to move it around. Any other player observed operating a kart will remain stationary - even if they are moving locally.",
